 ```
 
+The list is capped at 10, with undated items dropped first. `extract_action_items` cuts silently; `extract_with_report` returns the same items plus `omitted`, the number of valid items the cap removed. If `omitted` is above zero, the list is not the full set and should be sent with a note saying so.
+
 Run the tests from this directory with `python -m unittest`.
